    <Phrase Key="SurfaceDescription" Text="The ground underfoot: terrain and its sculpting, zones, roads and what stands on them, the ground under the wheels."/>
    <Phrase Key="SpaceDescription" Text="Star systems: stars and the bodies on their orbits, planets with relief and biomes, atmospheres and clouds."/>
    <Phrase Key="InteriorsDescription" Text="Inside the buildings: rooms and the openings between them, doors, light in the rooms."/>
    <Phrase Key="CharactersDescription" Text="Living things: skeleton and rig, animation clips and the transitions between them."/>
    <Phrase Key="StrategyDescription" Text="The game from above: units and their orders, resources and how they are gathered."/>
    <Phrase Key="SoundDescription" Text="The sound of the world: sources in the scene, echo by zone, music by event."/>
    <Phrase Key="VegetationDescription" Text="Forests and grass: plant sets, growth by biome, density by height and slope."/>
    <Phrase Key="WaterDescription" Text="Water on the terrain: rivers along their beds, lakes in the hollows, currents."/>
    <Phrase Key="DestructionDescription" Text="Cataclysms: cracks and collapses, debris, what was destroyed as a task to restore."/>
